    "https://www.meredith.edu/human-resources/applying-for-a-position/": {
      "title": "Applying for a Position",
      "description": "Applying for a Position - Meredith College Skip to content Navigation A-Z Careers Quick Links Accessibility Apply Arts Events Brightspace Calendar Campus Services Library MyMeredith News People Self Service Visit Information For Prospective Students Undergraduate Students Graduate Students Faculty & Staff Alumnae Parents & Families Community Career Planning: Employers En Español Giving Support Give now A-Z Careers Quick Links Accessibility Apply Arts Events Brightspace Calendar Campus Services Library MyMeredith News People Self Service Visit Information For Prospective Students Undergraduate Students Graduate Students Faculty & Staff Alumnae Parents & Families Community Career Planning: Employers En Español Giving Support Give now Search Search Academics Admissions Financial Aid Student life Athletics About STRONGPOINTS® Academics Admissions Financial Aid Student life Athletics About STRONGPOINTS® Human Resources / Applying for a Position Applying for a Position Applying for a Position Nondiscrimination Statement Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) Immigration Information About Meredith Title IX: Gender Discrimination / Sexual Violence Human Resources Staff Getting to Meredith Student Employment Employee Benefits Payroll Information It is Meredith College’s policy to provide and promote equal employment opportunity to all qualified persons. This applies to all aspects of the employment relationship, including, but not limited to, recruitment, selection, advancement, compensation, benefits, discipline, training, leave, transfer and termination. Current vacancies Log in to complete/update applications vacancies The online web-based system allows you to attach resumes, cover letters or other documents to your application. You may update or edit your application for additional positions as they become available. Applications may be entered from any online computer. For your convenience, computers are available in the Office of Human Resources (Park Center, first floor), in the Carlyle Campbell Library, or the Cate Center. We do not accept paper applications for any position posted online. If you need any assistance with the application process, please contact us at jobs@meredith.edu . Your application is important to us and we will contact you as soon as possible. Additional options for assistance are available by calling (919) 760-8898. If you need accommodation(s) in the application process because of a disability, please notify the Office of Human Resources of your requirements. All offers of employment are contingent upon satisfactory criminal background check results. Thank you for your interest in employment with Meredith College! Current Employees: MyMeredith Portal Contact Information 1st Floor Park Center (919) 760-8898 Fax: (919) 760-8164 hr@meredith.edu Facebook Tiktok Instagram Youtube X-twitter Threads Linkedin Giphy Logo Book an event! ONE OF AMERICA'S BEST COLLEGES PRINCETON REVIEW U.S. NEWS NICHE What Makes Us Strong A-Z Careers Giving at Meredith Emergency Planning Accessibility at Meredith Contact Us Title IX Information Accreditation & Nondiscrimination Privacy Policy A-Z Careers Giving at Meredith Emergency Planning Accessibility at Meredith Contact Us Title IX Information Accreditation & Nondiscrimination Privacy Policy Prospective Students Graduate Students Faculty & Staff Alumnae Parents & Families Community Career Planning: Employers En Español Prospective Students Graduate Students Faculty & Staff Alumnae Parents & Families Community Career Planning: Employers En Español (919)760-8600 (919)760-8330 3800 Hillsborough Street Raleigh, NC 27607-5298  © 2026 All Rights Reserved Apply Today Give Now Quick Links A-Z Apply to Meredith Arts Events Brightspace Calendar Campus Services Careers MyMeredith News People Self Service A-Z Apply to Meredith Arts Events Brightspace Calendar Campus Services Careers MyMeredith News People Self Service Primary Navigation Academics Admissions Financial A